## [Unreleased]

### Changed

- Rejected tool inputs now produce a warning naming the failing field and constraint without
  including the rejected value. Fixed loading the validator from native ES modules.

- Dynamic tool definitions now reuse validation for the same schema object across calls.
  Updated schemas sharing the same schema ID now take effect without a duplicate-ID error.
  Resolve the validator through its public package entry point.

- Static tool schemas are now compiled once at registration and reused for subsequent calls.
  Fixed validator initialization so the tool registry can be constructed reliably.

- Tool calls missing a required input property now return a readable validation result before the
  executor runs, allowing the model to correct the call.

